# The core loop on a normal new game (seed 1, the default), through the real keys:
# wake by the square, take driftwood, stone and dead wood, lay a fire, make
# charcoal, a haft and a pick at it, meet a machine and find its working side,
# see the night in with the lamp, and walk over the border into a second country.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/core_loop.tour --give=driftwood:6,scrap:1
# (--give tops the creel up so the making does not need twenty trips to the
# strand, and brings one plate from the tip fifty tiles inland.)
shot 01-wake-by-the-square
# The scripted stretch is not a random fight: nothing new comes until the machine is met.
coast calm
# Driftwood on the strand south-east of the spawn: step to it, press use.
at 163.69,404.79
walk 0,1 0.08
press use 0.1
await took 3
wait 0.2
shot 02-driftwood-taken
at 166.7,401.6
walk 1,1 0.08
press use 0.1
await took 3
# Dead wood fallen under the broadleaf by the strand.
at 162.45,403.25
walk 0,1 0.08
press use 0.1
await took 8
wait 0.2
shot 03-dead-wood
# A loose stone off each of two boulders.
at 156.95,408.87
walk -1,1 0.08
press use 0.1
await took 14
at 164.05,389.53
walk 1,-1 0.08
press use 0.1
await took 14
wait 0.2
shot 04-stone
# Open ground north of the strand: the first press asks, the second lays the fire.
at 166.5,393.5
walk 1,0 0.08
press use 0.1
wait 0.3
shot 05-asked-where
press use 0.1
await made 4
wait 0.5
shot 06-fire-laid
# Making at the fire: the page lists what this fire can make.
tap craft
wait 0.6
shot 07-making-page
choose charcoal
tap use
await made 3
wait 0.3
shot 08-charcoal-made
choose haft
tap use
await made 3
choose pick_made
tap use
await made 3
wait 0.3
shot 09-a-pick-from-plate
tap pause
wait 0.4
tap inventory
wait 0.6
shot 10-carrying-the-pick
tap inventory
wait 0.4
# A runner in the field north of the village. Met face on, the blow rings off
# its plate; its working part is at its back, and there the blow goes home.
at 130,370
zoom 10
wait 1.0
spawn runner
wait 0.3
walkto mob 1.5
tap swing
await ring 1.5
wait 0.04
shot 11-plate-rings
walkto part 3
tap swing
await hit 1.5
wait 0.04
shot 12-the-working-side
walkto part 2
tap swing
wait 0.5
walkto part 2
tap swing
wait 0.5
walkto part 2
tap swing
wait 0.6
shot 13-after-the-fight
coast calm
# Back to the fire as the light goes: the lamp against the dark.
zoom 15
at 165.5,393.5
hour 21.5
wait 0.6
shot 14-night-at-the-fire
press lamp 0.1
wait 0.5
walk -1,-1 1.2
shot 15-lamp-lit
walk 1,1 1.2
press use 0.1
wait 1.2
shot 16-slept-to-morning
# North to the border: the land turns to limestone and the notebook names it.
at 160.5,352.5
wait 0.5
shot 17-coast-before-the-border
walk 1,-1 4.5 run
wait 1.2
shot 18-into-the-bonelands
